## ✅ Gin + FireLens/Fluent Bit に最適なログ戦略

| ログレベル | 出力先 | Goコード内での出力方法 |
|------------|--------|--------------------------|
| `ERROR` 以上 | `STDERR` → CloudWatch Logs | `log.New(os.Stderr, ...)` or `fmt.Fprintln(os.Stderr, ...)` |
| `INFO`, `DEBUG`, `ACCESS` | `STDOUT` → FireLens → S3（Parquet） | `fmt.Println(...)` or `log.New(os.Stdout, ...)` |

---

## ✅ Go Gin 実装例

### 1. ロガー定義（stderr用 + stdout用）

```go
package logger

import (
	"log"
	"os"
)

var (
	ErrorLogger = log.New(os.Stderr, "[ERROR] ", log.LstdFlags|log.Lshortfile)
	InfoLogger  = log.New(os.Stdout, "[INFO] ", log.LstdFlags)
)
```

---

### 2. Gin に組み込む

```go
import (
	"github.com/gin-gonic/gin"
	"yourapp/logger"
)

func main() {
	r := gin.New()

	r.Use(gin.LoggerWithWriter(logger.InfoLogger.Writer()))
	r.Use(gin.RecoveryWithWriter(logger.ErrorLogger.Writer()))

	r.GET("/ping", func(c *gin.Context) {
		logger.InfoLogger.Println("accessed /ping")
		c.JSON(200, gin.H{"message": "pong"})
	})

	if err := r.Run(); err != nil {
		logger.ErrorLogger.Println("server error:", err)
	}
}
```

